  (text
    "3x LM61460-Q1 (6A) - one per M.2 slot. Module VCC window: Sierra EM92XX 3.135-4.4V, peak 3.0A, ripple <100mVpp 1-100kHz (PTS 4.3.3);\n  Telit FN990 VPH_PWR 3.135-4.4V, peak 4A, ripple max 30mV (HDG Rev 3 Tab.15). Both: VCC must stay >=3.3V for EM9293 GNSS bias.\nVout = 1.0V x (1 + 100k/36.5k) = 3.74V (headroom for connector/trace drop). fsw 400kHz (RT 33.2k), L = 3.3uH XAL7070.\nEN driven by TCA6416A (control sheet); 100k pull-down keeps slot OFF at power-up. PGOOD -> expander + PG LED.\nSlot bulk (2x220uF low-ESR + 1uF/100nF/pF HF caps; FN990 HDG recommends >=100uF low-ESR at the card) is on each slot sheet.\nNOTE: no active output discharge - after EN low allow bleed-down before re-enable (power-cycle = sysfs remove -> EN off -> wait -> EN on -> rescan)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20.32 330 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "9d623e36-17f4-5559-8e04-f9e6128fca8b"))
